---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { aff } from "../data/affiliates";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Kakheti wine day — tour vs car | ArriveGE"
  description="Kakheti wine day from Tbilisi: book a tasting tour with a driver, or rent a car if someone stays sober. Decide before the weekend."
>
  <header class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero-inner" data-reveal>
      <p class="section-kicker">Wine country</p>
      <h1>Kakheti wine day</h1>
      <p>You are tasting qvevri wine. Someone has to drive back. That single fact decides tour vs rental.</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="section content-grid">
    <article class="prose" data-reveal>
      <h2>Guided tasting tour</h2>
      <p>
        Driver included. Two or three wineries, lunch, return to Tbilisi. Best default for couples and small groups who
        came to drink, not to navigate village roads.
      </p>

      <h2>Rental car</h2>
      <p>
        More freedom on timing and overnight stays in the valley. Only if one adult stays under the limit and you are
        comfortable with Georgian highway driving.
      </p>

      <table class="compare">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Group</th>
            <th>Usually book</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td>Everyone wants to taste</td>
            <td>Tour with driver</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Multi-day Kakheti stay</td>
            <td>Car rental</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Solo traveler</td>
            <td>Small-group tour</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </article>

    <aside class="action-panel" data-reveal>
      <h2>Book the day</h2>
      <p>Affiliate links. Compare pickup time and winery count on the live page.</p>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href={aff("kakhetiTour")} target="_blank" rel="noopener sponsored noreferrer"
        >Kakheti wine tours</a
      >
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href={aff("carRental")} target="_blank" rel="noopener sponsored noreferrer"
        >Localrent (Georgia cars)</a
      >
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href={aff("carRentalAlt")} target="_blank" rel="noopener sponsored noreferrer"
        >GetRentacar</a
      >
      <p class="disclaimer">We may earn a commission if you book through these links.</p>
    </aside>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
